{"id": "97110134", "name": "המרת רדיאנים למעלות – kπ/n", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>לכמה מעלות שווה זווית של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</span> רדיאנים?</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( {{CT:0}}\\ \\text{rad}= \\) [[input:ans1]] \\( ^{\\circ} \\)</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: מספר בלבד, בלי סימן המעלות, למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">135</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> משתמשים בקשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\pi\\ \\text{rad}=180^{\\circ}\\)</span>, כלומר כופלים ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{180^{\\circ}}{\\pi}\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — יחס ההמרה</b><br>בסיבוב שלם יש <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(2\\pi\\)</span> רדיאנים ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(360^{\\circ}\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> רדיאנים הם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(180^{\\circ}\\)</span>, ורדיאן אחד הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{180^{\\circ}}{\\pi}\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — ההמרה</b><br>כופלים את הזווית ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{180^{\\circ}}{\\pi}\\)</span>; ה-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> מצטמצם:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}\\cdot\\frac{180^{\\circ}}{\\pi}=\\frac{ {{CT:1}} }{ {{CT:2}} }^{\\circ}={{CT:3}}^{\\circ} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:Result]]", "prtcorrect": "<span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה, כל הכבוד.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class=\"incorrect\">תשובה שגויה.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "degrees", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "degrees*2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">בסיבוב שלם יש <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:4}}\\)</span> רדיאנים, כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> רדיאנים הם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(180^{\\circ}\\)</span> (ולא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(360^{\\circ}\\)</span>).</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "degrees/2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">בסיבוב שלם יש <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:4}}\\)</span> רדיאנים, ולא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:5}}\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "recipmult", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">המרתם בכיוון ההפוך: זו הזווית <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</span> מעלות ברדיאנים. כדי לעבור מרדיאנים למעלות כופלים ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{180}{\\pi}\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "Result-3-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 4, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "recipmult/2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-4-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">נראה שהמרתם בכיוון ההפוך (ממעלות לרדיאנים). שימו לב גם שבסיבוב שלם יש <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:4}}\\)</span> רדיאנים, ולא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\pi\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-4-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["degrees", "k", "n", "radians", "recipmult", "revolution_radians", "two_revolutions"], "nvariants": 50}